# Working files kept beside the project that nothing at runtime reads. The
# same set .gitignore already refuses, named again here because the build
# context is the working directory rather than the git index: a local
# `fly deploy` uploads whatever is on disk, and there is over a hundred
# megabytes of reference PDF sitting in this folder right now.
#
# It used to name livro-referencia.pdf alone, which stopped being enough the
# moment a second book was left here.
*.pdf
*.zip

# Proposals, notes and design handoffs. They are versioned on purpose and they
# belong in the repository; they do not belong in a runtime image.
propostas-historias.md
design_handoff_livro_colorir/
